  "description": "Weathered is a vintage distressed typeface family inspired by authentic workwear labels, heritage denim branding, old western signage, and classic American industrial typography. Designed with a bold condensed structure and rich weathered texture, this font delivers a rugged, handcrafted appearance that captures the charm of aged prints and timeworn materials. The family includes four versatile styles—Regular, Italic, Outline, and Distressed—allowing you to create eye-catching combinations for logos, apparel designs, packaging, labels, posters, wall art, branding projects, and vintage-inspired merchandise. Whether you’re designing for a rustic workshop aesthetic, retro advertising, heritage products, or timeless western themes, Weathered brings strong character, authenticity, and premium vintage appeal to every project.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Weathered is a vintage distressed typeface family inspired by authentic workwear labels, heritage denim branding, old western signage, and classic American industrial typography. Designed with a bold condensed structure and rich weathered texture, this font delivers a rugged, handcrafted appearance that captures the charm of aged prints and timeworn materials. The family includes four versatile styles—Regular, Italic, Outline, and Distressed—allowing you to create eye-catching combinations for logos, apparel designs, packaging, labels, posters, wall art, branding projects, and vintage-inspired merchandise. Whether you’re designing for a rustic workshop aesthetic, retro advertising, heritage products, or timeless western themes, Weathered brings strong character, authenticity, and premium vintage appeal to every project.</p>",
